[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12783.11, "timestamp": "03:33:03", "text": "有时候只有米饭，我想嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12787.269, "timestamp": "03:33:07", "text": "今天我吃了RXR，你知道RXR吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12790.15, "timestamp": "03:33:10", "text": "是的，我知道。我知道。他去过那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12792.95, "timestamp": "03:33:12", "text": "是不是感觉回到了过去的日子？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12795.51, "timestamp": "03:33:15", "text": "是的。所以，RXel 就是这么说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12798.55, "timestamp": "03:33:18", "text": "就像我们已经习惯了那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12800.95, "timestamp": "03:33:20", "text": "吃米饭，对吧？所以，如果我们吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12803.59, "timestamp": "03:33:23", "text": "别的什么东西，感觉就不像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12806.469, "timestamp": "03:33:26", "text": "整顿饭。就像，是的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12809.99, "timestamp": "03:33:29", "text": "没好好吃饭。你需要大米"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12811.83, "timestamp": "03:33:31", "text": "把肚子填饱之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12814.95, "timestamp": "03:33:34", "text": "是吗？我们是否存在这个问题？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12821.429, "timestamp": "03:33:41", "text": "呃，好像只有米饭才能填饱肚子似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12823.91, "timestamp": "03:33:43", "text": "是啊，就像只有米饭才能配米饭一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12826.389, "timestamp": "03:33:46", "text": "让你感觉好像已经吃饱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12828.309, "timestamp": "03:33:48", "text": "你肯定吃得很好之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12830.309, "timestamp": "03:33:50", "text": "好的。问题是，嗯，这有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12833.51, "timestamp": "03:33:53", "text": "正确，因为吃一块巧克力棒或印度薄饼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12835.429, "timestamp": "03:33:55", "text": "感觉好像已经吃饱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12839.75, "timestamp": "03:33:59", "text": "大概两个小时左右吧。是的。"}]